# Frontend

- Reuse existing providers and DTOs — no duplicate models or parallel state patterns.
- Keep UI state, API DTOs, and backend contracts aligned.
- Surface honest placeholder/loading/empty/error states; avoid mock data when endpoints exist.
- Do not wire incomplete backend features as production-ready.
- Preserve existing functionality before visual polish.
